IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXDICT.

*> Local DICT test double.
*> Models the participant-facing DICT registry and claim lifecycle so key
*> ownership, portability (portabilidade) and possession claims
*> (reivindicao de posse) can be exercised deterministically without a
*> Banco Central connection.  Adapter=FIXTURE in etc/pix.cfg means "this
*> program", not a live integration: no mTLS, no XML signatures, no RSFN.
*>
*> Lifecycle follows the current BCB "DICT API 2.x" public specification:
*>   OPEN -> WAITING_RESOLUTION -> CONFIRMED -> COMPLETED
*>        \-> CANCELLED reachable from OPEN / WAITING / CONFIRMED per the
*>         actor/reason matrices (USER_REQUESTED, ACCOUNT_CLOSURE, FRAUD,
*>         DEFAULT_OPERATION, RECONCILIATION, RFB_VALIDATION).
*>   - Claims are always initiated by the claimant PSP (reivindicador).
*>   - OWNERSHIP (possession) claims are restricted to PHONE keys.
*>   - PORTABILITY claims cover PHONE, EMAIL, CPF, CNPJ (never EVP/RANDOM).
*>   - OWNERSHIP: donor and claimant may be the same participant.
*>   - acknowledge / confirm / cancel / complete are idempotent: a repeated
*>     request with the same request id and parameters returns the original
*>     outcome (DT-REPLAY=Y) without moving the state machine twice.
*>   - Resolution and completion periods are DISTINCT and come from
*>     institution-side configuration (claim-resolution-days /
*>     claim-completion-days in etc/pix.cfg).  The regulatory durations
*>     themselves are NOT hard-coded here; only the two-period semantics.
*>   - A key with a non-terminal claim is locked for change/delete
*>     (EntryLockedByClaim).
*>   - Expired claims (now past CompletionPeriodEnd with no resolution)
*>     are cancelled lazily at the next touch of the key, by the double
*>     itself, so no batch subsystem is required.
*>   - Per-entry version (DTR-VERSION) never regresses: stale DICT answers
*>     are refused rather than applied (sync version semantics).

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT DICT-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-DICT-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS DTR-UDKEY OF DICT-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-DICT-ST.
    SELECT DKEY-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-DKEY-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS DTI-KEY-ID OF DKEY-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-DKEY-ST.
    SELECT CLAIM-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-CLAIM-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CLM-ID OF CLAIM-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-CLAIM-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD DICT-FILE.
01 DICT-REC.
   05 DTR-UDKEY         PIC X(26).
   05 DTR-KEY-TYPE      PIC X(10).
   05 DTR-KEY-HASH      PIC X(16).
   05 DTR-KEY-MASK      PIC X(30).
   05 DTR-KEY-ID        PIC X(12).
   05 DTR-PART          PIC X(12).
   05 DTR-ACCT          PIC X(12).
   05 DTR-CUST          PIC X(12).
   05 DTR-NAME          PIC X(60).
   05 DTR-KEY-STATUS    PIC X(12).
   05 DTR-CLAIM-STATUS  PIC X(18).
   05 DTR-CLAIM-ID      PIC X(24).
   05 DTR-FRAUD-FLAG    PIC X(01).
   05 DTR-SELF-FLAG     PIC X(01).
   05 DTR-DATE          PIC 9(08).
   05 DTR-CREATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 DTR-UPDATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 DTR-VERSION       PIC 9(05).
   05 DTR-REQ-KEY       PIC X(24).
   05 DTR-REQ-SIG       PIC X(60).
FD DKEY-FILE.
01 DKEY-REC.
   05 DTI-KEY-ID        PIC X(12).
   05 DTI-UDKEY         PIC X(26).
FD CLAIM-FILE.
01 CLAIM-REC.
   05 CLM-ID            PIC X(24).
   05 CLM-REQ-ID        PIC X(24).
   05 CLM-UDKEY         PIC X(26).
   05 CLM-KEY-ID        PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-KEY-TYPE      PIC X(10).
   05 CLM-TYPE          PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-SRC-PART      PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-DST-PART      PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-ACCT          PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-CUST          PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-DONOR-CUST    PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-DONOR-ACCT    PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-STATUS        PIC X(18).
   05 CLM-RESOL-END     PIC 9(08).
   05 CLM-COMPL-END     PIC 9(08).
   05 CLM-CONFIRM-REASON PIC X(20).
   05 CLM-CANCEL-REASON PIC X(20).
   05 CLM-CANCELLED-BY  PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-REASON        PIC X(40).
   05 CLM-OP-REQ-ID     PIC X(24).
   05 CLM-OP-SIG        PIC X(60).
   05 CLM-OP-ACTOR      PIC X(12).
   05 CLM-DATE          PIC 9(08).
   05 CLM-CREATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 CLM-UPDATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 CLM-VERSION       PIC 9(05).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "BPXCFG".
COPY "BPXKVP".
COPY "BDATP".
01 WS-DICT-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-DKEY-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-CLAIM-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-DICT-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-DKEY-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-CLAIM-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-UDKEY PIC X(26).
01 WS-CFG-REC.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-ID-TYPE PIC X(08).
01 WS-ISPB PIC X(08).
01 WS-ID-VAL PIC X(32).
01 WS-ID-RC PIC X(02).
01 WS-EXIST PIC X(01).
01 WS-NEW PIC X(01).
01 WS-LOCK-NAME PIC X(24).
01 WS-LOCK-OWNER PIC X(16).
01 WS-LOCK-MODE PIC X(01).
01 WS-LOCK-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-LOCKED PIC X(01).
01 WS-SIG PIC X(72).
01 WS-DEADLINE PIC 9(08).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-FOUND PIC X(01).
01 WS-ACTOR PIC X(20).
01 WS-DONOR PIC X(12).
01 WS-CLAIMER PIC X(12).
01 WS-DAYS PIC S9(09).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BPXDP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-PX-DICT-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO DT-MSG
    MOVE "N" TO DT-REPLAY
    MOVE "N" TO WS-LOCKED
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    PERFORM BUILD-PATHS
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG-REC
    CALL "BPXCFG" USING BK-PX-CFG
    IF DT-SIM = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SIMULATE TO DT-SIM
    END-IF
    PERFORM APPLY-SIMULATION
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-OP)
        WHEN "KEY-REGISTER" PERFORM DO-REGISTER
        WHEN "KEY-SEED" PERFORM DO-SEED
        WHEN "KEY-LOOKUP" PERFORM DO-LOOKUP
        WHEN "KEY-DICT-GET" PERFORM DO-DICT-GET
        WHEN "KEY-CHANGE" PERFORM DO-CHANGE
        WHEN "KEY-DELETE" PERFORM DO-DELETE
        WHEN "CLAIM-CREATE" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-CREATE
        WHEN "CLAIM-ACK" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-ACK
        WHEN "CLAIM-CONFIRM" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-CONFIRM
        WHEN "CLAIM-CANCEL" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-CANCEL
        WHEN "CLAIM-COMPLETE" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-COMPLETE
        WHEN "CLAIM-GET" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-GET
        WHEN "CLAIM-LIST" PERFORM DO-CLAIM-LIST
        WHEN "DICT-SYNC" PERFORM DO-SYNC
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN DICT OP" TO DT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    IF WS-LOCKED = "Y"
        PERFORM RELEASE-LOCK
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

APPLY-SIMULATION.
    IF DT-SIM = SPACES OR DT-SIM = "NONE"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-SIM)
        WHEN "TIMEOUT"
            MOVE "24" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT TIMEOUT OUTCOME UNKNOWN" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN "FAIL"
            MOVE "09" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT UNAVAILABLE" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN "REJECT"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT REJECTED REQUEST" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN "DUPLICATE"
            MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT REPORTS KEY DUPLICATE" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN "NOTFOUND"
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT REPORTS KEY NOT FOUND" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN "CORRUPT"
            MOVE "21" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT INCONSISTENT RESPONSE" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN DICT SIMULATION" TO DT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE.

DO-REGISTER.
    PERFORM CANONICALIZE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
    IF WS-EXIST = "Y" AND DTR-KEY-STATUS NOT = "RELEASED" AND
       DTR-KEY-STATUS NOT = "REVOKED"
        MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY ALREADY REGISTERED IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLEAR-REQ
    IF DT-PART = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SELF TO DT-PART
    END-IF
    PERFORM ENSURE-KEY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-NEW
    PERFORM WRITE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "ACTIVE" TO DT-KEY-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO DT-CLAIM-ID.

DO-SEED.
    PERFORM CANONICALIZE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SELF TO DT-PART
    END-IF
    PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
    IF WS-EXIST = "Y"
        MOVE "N" TO WS-NEW
        MOVE DTR-KEY-ID OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-ID
    ELSE
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-NEW
        PERFORM ENSURE-KEY-ID
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLEAR-REQ
    PERFORM WRITE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
    MOVE "DICT ENTRY SEEDED" TO DT-MSG.

DO-LOOKUP.
    PERFORM CANONICALIZE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
    IF WS-EXIST NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY NOT REGISTERED IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
    IF DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC NOT = "ACTIVE" OR
       DTR-FRAUD-FLAG OF DICT-REC = "Y"
        MOVE SPACES TO DT-KEY-ID DT-KEY-TYPE DT-KEY-HASH DT-KEY-MASK
        MOVE SPACES TO DT-PART DT-ACCT DT-CUST DT-NAME DT-KEY-STATUS
        MOVE SPACES TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS DT-CLAIM-ID
        MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY NOT AVAILABLE" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-DICT-GET.
    PERFORM LOAD-BY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC NOT = "ACTIVE" OR
       DTR-FRAUD-FLAG OF DICT-REC = "Y"
        MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY NOT AVAILABLE" TO DT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY.

DO-CHANGE.
    PERFORM LOAD-BY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DTR-KEY-STATUS NOT = "ACTIVE"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY NOT ACTIVE IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLAIM-GUARD
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-ACCT NOT = SPACES
        MOVE DT-ACCT TO DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC
    END-IF
    IF DT-CUST NOT = SPACES
        MOVE DT-CUST TO DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC
    END-IF
    IF DT-NAME NOT = SPACES
        MOVE DT-NAME TO DTR-NAME OF DICT-REC
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLEAR-REQ
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
    END-IF.

DO-DELETE.
    PERFORM LOAD-BY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    PERFORM CLAIM-GUARD
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "RELEASED" TO DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM CLEAR-REQ
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        MOVE "RELEASED" TO DT-KEY-STATUS
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-CREATE.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-TARGET
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC NOT = "ACTIVE"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY NOT ACTIVE IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DTR-FRAUD-FLAG OF DICT-REC = "Y"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY FRAUD RESTRICTED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF PC-CLAIM-RES-DAYS = 0 OR PC-CLAIM-CMP-DAYS = 0
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM WINDOWS NOT CONFIGURED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SELF TO DT-PART
    END-IF
    PERFORM FIND-DUPLICATE-REQUEST
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-REPLAY = "Y"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLAIM-GUARD
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CHECK-CREATE-SEMANTICS
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM REQUEST ID REQUIRED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "CLAIM" TO WS-ID-TYPE
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ISPB
    CALL "BPXID" USING WS-ID-TYPE WS-ISPB WS-ID-VAL WS-ID-RC
    IF WS-ID-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "09" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT CLAIM SEQUENCE ERROR" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-ID-VAL(1:24) TO DT-CLAIM-ID
    PERFORM ADD-DAYS-CFG
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE SPACES TO CLAIM-REC
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-ID TO CLM-ID
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID TO CLM-REQ-ID
    MOVE WS-UDKEY TO CLM-UDKEY
    MOVE DTR-KEY-ID OF DICT-REC TO CLM-KEY-ID
    MOVE DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC TO CLM-KEY-TYPE
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-TYPE TO CLM-TYPE
    MOVE DTR-PART OF DICT-REC TO CLM-SRC-PART
    MOVE DT-PART TO CLM-DST-PART
    MOVE DT-ACCT TO CLM-ACCT
    MOVE DT-CUST TO CLM-CUST
    MOVE DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC TO CLM-DONOR-CUST
    MOVE DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC TO CLM-DONOR-ACCT
    MOVE "OPEN" TO CLM-STATUS
    MOVE DT-RESOL-END TO CLM-RESOL-END
    MOVE DT-COMPL-END TO CLM-COMPL-END
    MOVE DT-REASON TO CLM-REASON
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID TO CLM-OP-REQ-ID
    PERFORM BUILD-CREATE-SIG
    MOVE WS-SIG TO CLM-OP-SIG
    MOVE DT-PART TO CLM-OP-ACTOR
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO CLM-DATE
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO CLM-CREATED
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO CLM-UPDATED
    MOVE 1 TO CLM-VERSION
    PERFORM OPEN-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    WRITE CLAIM-REC
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT CLAIM ALREADY EXISTS" TO DT-MSG
    END-WRITE
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "OPEN" TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-ID TO DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        MOVE "OPEN" TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
        MOVE "CLAIM CREATED" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-ACK.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-FULL
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-ACTOR
    IF CLM-STATUS = "WAITING_RESOLUTION"
        PERFORM REPLAY-CHECK
        MOVE "CLAIM ALREADY RECEIVED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CLM-STATUS NOT = "OPEN"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR NOT = CLM-SRC-PART
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "WAITING_RESOLUTION" TO CLM-STATUS
    PERFORM STAMP-OP
    PERFORM SAVE-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE CLM-STATUS TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        MOVE "CLAIM RECEIVED" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-CONFIRM.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-FULL
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-ACTOR
    IF CLM-STATUS = "CONFIRMED"
        PERFORM REPLAY-CHECK
        MOVE "CLAIM ALREADY CONFIRMED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CLM-STATUS NOT = "WAITING_RESOLUTION"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CHECK-CONFIRM-MATRIX
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "CONFIRMED" TO CLM-STATUS
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON) TO CLM-CONFIRM-REASON
    IF CLM-TYPE = "OWNERSHIP" AND
       FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON) = "USER_REQUESTED"
        MOVE 0 TO CLM-COMPL-END
    END-IF
    PERFORM STAMP-OP
    PERFORM SAVE-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM APPLY-CONFIRM-TO-ENTRY
    MOVE CLM-STATUS TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        MOVE "CONFIRMED" TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
        MOVE "CLAIM CONFIRMED; DONOR LINK REMOVED" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-CANCEL.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-FULL
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-ACTOR
    IF CLM-STATUS = "CANCELLED"
        PERFORM REPLAY-CHECK
        MOVE "CLAIM ALREADY CANCELLED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CHECK-CANCEL-RULES
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "CANCELLED" TO CLM-STATUS
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON) TO CLM-CANCEL-REASON
    IF DT-PART = CLM-SRC-PART
        MOVE "DONOR" TO CLM-CANCELLED-BY
    ELSE
        MOVE "CLAIMER" TO CLM-CANCELLED-BY
    END-IF
    PERFORM STAMP-OP
    PERFORM SAVE-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM REVERT-CONFIRM-IF-NEEDED
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        MOVE "CANCELLED" TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
        MOVE "CLAIM CANCELLED; DONOR OWNS KEY" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-COMPLETE.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-FULL
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPIRE-STALE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-ACTOR
    IF CLM-STATUS = "COMPLETED"
        PERFORM REPLAY-CHECK
        MOVE "CLAIM ALREADY COMPLETED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CLM-STATUS NOT = "CONFIRMED"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-DST-PART
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CLM-TYPE = "OWNERSHIP" AND CLM-COMPL-END > 0 AND
       WS-BIZDATE <= CLM-COMPL-END
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM COMPLETION PERIOD NOT ENDED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "COMPLETED" TO CLM-STATUS
    PERFORM STAMP-OP
    PERFORM SAVE-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DTR-DATE OF DICT-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
    PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
    IF DT-RC = "00"
        PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        MOVE "COMPLETED" TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
        MOVE "CLAIM COMPLETED; CLAIMER OWNS KEY" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-CLAIM-GET.
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-BY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
    MOVE "CLAIM" TO DT-MSG.

DO-CLAIM-LIST.
    MOVE 0 TO DT-COUNT
    PERFORM OPEN-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    MOVE SPACES TO CLAIM-REC
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ CLAIM-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                IF DT-CLAIM-STATUS = SPACES OR
                   CLM-STATUS = FUNCTION TRIM(DT-CLAIM-STATUS)
                    IF DT-CLAIM-TYPE = SPACES OR
                       CLM-TYPE = FUNCTION TRIM(DT-CLAIM-TYPE)
                        ADD 1 TO DT-COUNT
                    END-IF
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE
    MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
    MOVE "CLAIM LIST" TO DT-MSG.

CHECK-CREATE-SEMANTICS.
    IF DT-CLAIM-TYPE NOT = "OWNERSHIP" AND
       DT-CLAIM-TYPE NOT = "PORTABILITY"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM TYPE REQUIRED (OWNERSHIP/PORTABILITY)"
            TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SELF TO DT-PART
    END-IF
    IF DT-ACCT = SPACES OR DT-CUST = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIMER ACCOUNT AND CUSTOMER REQUIRED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-CLAIM-TYPE = "OWNERSHIP"
        IF DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC NOT = "PHONE"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "POSSESSION CLAIM RESTRICTED TO PHONE KEY"
                TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC = DT-CUST
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM TYPE INCONSISTENT: KEY ALREADY OWNED"
                TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC = "EVP" OR
           DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC = "RANDOM"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "KEY TYPE NOT PORTABLE" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC NOT = DT-CUST
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM TYPE INCONSISTENT: NOT KEY OWNER"
                TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF DTR-PART OF DICT-REC = DT-PART AND
           DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC = DT-ACCT
            MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "RESULTING ENTRY ALREADY EXISTS" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF.

CHECK-CONFIRM-MATRIX.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON) TO WS-ACTOR
    IF CLM-TYPE = "OWNERSHIP"
        IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-SRC-PART
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF WS-ACTOR = "DEFAULT_OPERATION"
            IF WS-BIZDATE <= CLM-RESOL-END
                MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "CLAIM RESOLUTION PERIOD NOT ENDED"
                    TO DT-MSG
                PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
            END-IF
        ELSE
            IF WS-ACTOR NOT = "USER_REQUESTED"
                MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
                PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF WS-ACTOR = "USER_REQUESTED"
            IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-SRC-PART
                MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
                PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
            END-IF
        ELSE
            IF WS-ACTOR = "ACCOUNT_CLOSURE" AND
               DT-PART = CLM-DST-PART
                CONTINUE
            ELSE
                MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.

CHECK-CANCEL-RULES.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON) TO WS-ACTOR
    IF CLM-TYPE = "PORTABILITY"
        PERFORM CHECK-CANCEL-PORT
    ELSE
        PERFORM CHECK-CANCEL-OWNERSHIP
    END-IF.

CHECK-CANCEL-PORT.
    IF CLM-STATUS NOT = "OPEN" AND CLM-STATUS NOT =
       "WAITING_RESOLUTION" AND CLM-STATUS NOT = "CONFIRMED"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CLM-STATUS = "CONFIRMED"
        IF WS-ACTOR NOT = "FRAUD" AND WS-ACTOR NOT =
           "RECONCILIATION" AND WS-ACTOR NOT = "RFB_VALIDATION"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-DST-PART
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "DEFAULT_OPERATION"
        IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-SRC-PART
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF WS-BIZDATE <= CLM-RESOL-END
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM RESOLUTION PERIOD NOT ENDED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "ACCOUNT_CLOSURE"
        IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-DST-PART
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "USER_REQUESTED" OR WS-ACTOR = "FRAUD"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "RECONCILIATION"
        IF CLM-STATUS = "WAITING_RESOLUTION"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "RFB_VALIDATION"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
    MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG.

CHECK-CANCEL-OWNERSHIP.
    IF CLM-STATUS NOT = "OPEN" AND CLM-STATUS NOT =
       "WAITING_RESOLUTION" AND CLM-STATUS NOT = "CONFIRMED"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART = CLM-SRC-PART
        IF WS-ACTOR NOT = "FRAUD"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART NOT = CLM-DST-PART
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PARTICIPANT NOT AUTHORISED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-ACTOR = "DEFAULT_OPERATION"
        IF WS-BIZDATE <= CLM-RESOL-END
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM RESOLUTION PERIOD NOT ENDED" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF WS-ACTOR NOT = "USER_REQUESTED" AND WS-ACTOR NOT =
           "FRAUD"
            MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "CLAIM OPERATION INVALID" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF.

APPLY-CONFIRM-TO-ENTRY.
    MOVE CLM-DST-PART TO DTR-PART OF DICT-REC
    IF CLM-ACCT NOT = SPACES
        MOVE CLM-ACCT TO DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC
    END-IF
    IF CLM-CUST NOT = SPACES
        MOVE CLM-CUST TO DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC
    END-IF
    MOVE "ACTIVE" TO DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC
    IF DTR-PART OF DICT-REC = FUNCTION TRIM(PC-SELF)
        MOVE "Y" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG OF DICT-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG OF DICT-REC
    END-IF.

REVERT-CONFIRM-IF-NEEDED.
    IF DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC NOT = "CONFIRMED"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CLM-SRC-PART TO DTR-PART OF DICT-REC
    MOVE CLM-DONOR-ACCT TO DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC
    MOVE CLM-DONOR-CUST TO DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC
    IF DTR-PART OF DICT-REC = FUNCTION TRIM(PC-SELF)
        MOVE "Y" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG OF DICT-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG OF DICT-REC
    END-IF.

RESOLVE-ACTOR.
    IF DT-PART = SPACES
        MOVE PC-SELF TO DT-PART
    END-IF
    MOVE DT-PART TO WS-ACTOR.

STAMP-OP.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO CLM-UPDATED
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO CLM-DATE
    ADD 1 TO CLM-VERSION
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID TO CLM-OP-REQ-ID
    PERFORM BUILD-OP-SIG
    MOVE WS-SIG TO CLM-OP-SIG
    MOVE DT-PART TO CLM-OP-ACTOR.

REPLAY-CHECK.
    MOVE "N" TO DT-REPLAY
    IF DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "Y" TO DT-REPLAY
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-OP-SIG
    IF CLM-OP-SIG = WS-SIG AND CLM-OP-REQ-ID = DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID
        MOVE "Y" TO DT-REPLAY
        MOVE CLM-STATUS TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
    END-IF.

BUILD-OP-SIG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-SIG
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(DT-OP) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-PART) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(CLM-TYPE) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-REASON)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-SIG
    END-STRING.

EXPIRE-STALE.
    IF DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC = "OPEN" OR
       DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC = "WAITING_RESOLUTION"
        MOVE DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC TO DT-CLAIM-ID
        PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-BY-ID
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
            MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
            PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
            PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
            CONTINUE
        END-IF
        IF CLM-COMPL-END > 0 AND WS-BIZDATE > CLM-COMPL-END
            MOVE "CANCELLED" TO CLM-STATUS
            MOVE "DEFAULT_OPERATION" TO CLM-CANCEL-REASON
            MOVE "EXPIRED" TO CLM-CANCELLED-BY
            MOVE SPACES TO CLM-OP-SIG
            MOVE SPACES TO CLM-OP-REQ-ID
            MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
            MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO CLM-UPDATED
            ADD 1 TO CLM-VERSION
            PERFORM SAVE-CLAIM
            MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC
            MOVE SPACES TO DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC
            PERFORM MARK-UPDATED
            PERFORM SAVE-ENTRY
            MOVE "CLAIM EXPIRED" TO DT-MSG
        END-IF
    END-IF.

CLAIM-GUARD.
    IF DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC = "OPEN" OR
       DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC = "WAITING_RESOLUTION" OR
       DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC = "CONFIRMED"
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "KEY LOCKED BY ACTIVE CLAIM" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF.

FIND-DUPLICATE-REQUEST.
    MOVE "N" TO DT-REPLAY
    PERFORM OPEN-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    MOVE SPACES TO CLAIM-REC
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y" OR DT-REPLAY = "Y" OR
        DT-RC NOT = "00"
        READ CLAIM-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                IF CLM-REQ-ID = DT-CLAIM-REQ-ID AND
                   CLM-DST-PART = DT-PART AND
                   CLM-UDKEY = WS-UDKEY
                    PERFORM BUILD-CREATE-SIG
                    IF CLM-OP-SIG = WS-SIG
                        MOVE "Y" TO DT-REPLAY
                        MOVE CLM-ID TO DT-CLAIM-ID
                        MOVE CLM-STATUS TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
                        MOVE CLM-RESOL-END TO DT-RESOL-END
                        MOVE CLM-COMPL-END TO DT-COMPL-END
                        PERFORM EXPOSE-CLAIM
                        MOVE "CLAIM REPLAY" TO DT-MSG
                    ELSE
                        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
                        MOVE "REQUEST ID ALREADY USED"
                            TO DT-MSG
                    END-IF
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE
    IF WS-EOF = "Y" AND DT-REPLAY NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "00" TO DT-RC
    END-IF.

BUILD-CREATE-SIG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-SIG
    STRING "CREATE" DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(DT-PART) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(DT-CLAIM-TYPE) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-ACCT)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-SIG
    END-STRING.

ADD-DAYS-CFG.
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DAT-DATE
    MOVE PC-CLAIM-RES-DAYS TO DAT-DAYS
    MOVE "ADD-DAYS" TO DAT-OP
    CALL "BDAT" USING BK-DAT-PARMS
    IF DAT-RC = "00"
        MOVE DAT-RESULT TO DT-RESOL-END
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DT-RESOL-END
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DAT-DATE
    MOVE PC-CLAIM-CMP-DAYS TO DAT-DAYS
    MOVE "ADD-DAYS" TO DAT-OP
    CALL "BDAT" USING BK-DAT-PARMS
    IF DAT-RC = "00"
        MOVE DAT-RESULT TO DT-COMPL-END
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DT-COMPL-END
    END-IF.

CLEAR-REQ.
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-REQ-KEY OF DICT-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO DTR-REQ-SIG OF DICT-REC.

CANONICALIZE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-KEY-VAL
    MOVE DT-KEY-TYPE TO KV-TYPE
    MOVE DT-KEY-VALUE TO KV-VALUE
    CALL "BPXKV" USING BK-PX-KEY-VAL
    IF KV-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE KV-RC TO DT-RC
        MOVE KV-MSG TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE KV-TYPE TO DT-KEY-TYPE
    MOVE KV-HASH TO DT-KEY-HASH
    MOVE KV-MASK TO DT-KEY-MASK
    MOVE KV-VERIFIED TO DT-VERIFIED
    PERFORM BUILD-UDKEY.

BUILD-UDKEY.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-UDKEY
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(DT-KEY-TYPE) DELIMITED SIZE DT-KEY-HASH
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-UDKEY
    END-STRING.

ENSURE-KEY-ID.
    IF DT-KEY-ID NOT = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE "KEY" TO WS-ID-TYPE
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ISPB
    CALL "BPXID" USING WS-ID-TYPE WS-ISPB WS-ID-VAL WS-ID-RC
    IF WS-ID-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "09" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY SEQUENCE ERROR" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-ID-VAL(1:12) TO DT-KEY-ID.

LOAD-CLAIM-TARGET.
    IF DT-KEY-ID NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM LOAD-BY-ID
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE DTR-UDKEY OF DICT-REC TO WS-UDKEY
        PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    ELSE
        PERFORM CANONICALIZE
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
        IF WS-EXIST NOT = "Y"
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PIX KEY NOT REGISTERED IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF.

LOAD-CLAIM-FULL.
    IF DT-CLAIM-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM ID REQUIRED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM LOAD-CLAIM-BY-ID
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO DICT-REC
    MOVE CLM-UDKEY TO WS-UDKEY
    MOVE CLM-UDKEY TO DTR-UDKEY
    MOVE CLM-KEY-ID TO DT-KEY-ID
    PERFORM ACQUIRE-LOCK
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
    IF WS-EXIST NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY NOT REGISTERED IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC NOT = CLM-ID
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "CLAIM NOT ACTIVE FOR KEY" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF.

WRITE-ENTRY.
    MOVE SPACES TO DICT-REC
    MOVE WS-UDKEY TO DTR-UDKEY
    MOVE DT-KEY-TYPE TO DTR-KEY-TYPE
    MOVE DT-KEY-HASH TO DTR-KEY-HASH
    MOVE DT-KEY-MASK TO DTR-KEY-MASK
    MOVE DT-KEY-ID TO DTR-KEY-ID
    MOVE DT-PART TO DTR-PART
    MOVE DT-ACCT TO DTR-ACCT
    MOVE DT-CUST TO DTR-CUST
    MOVE DT-NAME TO DTR-NAME
    IF DT-KEY-STATUS = SPACES
        MOVE "ACTIVE" TO DTR-KEY-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE DT-KEY-STATUS TO DTR-KEY-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF DT-FRAUD-FLAG = "Y"
        MOVE "Y" TO DTR-FRAUD-FLAG
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO DTR-FRAUD-FLAG
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART = FUNCTION TRIM(PC-SELF)
        MOVE "Y" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO DTR-SELF-FLAG
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO DTR-DATE
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    IF WS-NEW = "Y"
        MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO DTR-CREATED
        MOVE 1 TO DTR-VERSION
    ELSE
        MOVE DTR-CREATED OF DICT-REC TO DTR-CREATED
        MOVE DTR-VERSION OF DICT-REC TO DTR-VERSION
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO DTR-UPDATED
    PERFORM OPEN-DICT
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-NEW = "Y"
        WRITE DICT-REC
            INVALID KEY
                MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "DICT ENTRY ALREADY EXISTS" TO DT-MSG
        END-WRITE
    ELSE
        REWRITE DICT-REC
            INVALID KEY
                MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
                MOVE "DICT ENTRY MISSING" TO DT-MSG
        END-REWRITE
    END-IF
    CLOSE DICT-FILE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM SAVE-KEY-INDEX.

SAVE-KEY-INDEX.
    PERFORM OPEN-DKEY
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO DKEY-REC
    MOVE DT-KEY-ID TO DTI-KEY-ID
    MOVE WS-UDKEY TO DTI-UDKEY
    WRITE DKEY-REC
        INVALID KEY
            CONTINUE
    END-WRITE
    CLOSE DKEY-FILE.

FIND-ENTRY.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EXIST
    PERFORM OPEN-DICT
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO DICT-REC
    MOVE WS-UDKEY TO DTR-UDKEY
    READ DICT-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-DICT-ST
        WHEN "00" MOVE "Y" TO WS-EXIST
        WHEN "23" CONTINUE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE WS-DICT-ST TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT STORE ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE DICT-FILE.

LOAD-BY-ID.
    IF DT-KEY-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY ID REQUIRED" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM OPEN-DKEY
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO DKEY-REC
    MOVE DT-KEY-ID TO DTI-KEY-ID
    READ DKEY-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-DKEY-ST
        WHEN "00" CONTINUE
        WHEN "23"
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PIX KEY NOT FOUND IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE WS-DKEY-ST TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT INDEX ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE DKEY-FILE
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE DTI-UDKEY TO WS-UDKEY
    PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
    IF WS-EXIST NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY NOT FOUND IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

LOAD-CLAIM-BY-ID.
    PERFORM OPEN-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO CLAIM-REC
    MOVE DT-CLAIM-ID TO CLM-ID
    READ CLAIM-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-CLAIM-ST
        WHEN "00" CONTINUE
        WHEN "23"
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT CLAIM NOT FOUND" TO DT-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE WS-CLAIM-ST TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT CLAIM STORE ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE.

SAVE-CLAIM.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO CLM-UPDATED
    PERFORM OPEN-CLAIM
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    REWRITE CLAIM-REC
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT CLAIM MISSING" TO DT-MSG
    END-REWRITE
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE.

MARK-UPDATED.
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO DTR-UPDATED OF DICT-REC
    ADD 1 TO DTR-VERSION OF DICT-REC.

SAVE-ENTRY.
    PERFORM OPEN-DICT
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    REWRITE DICT-REC
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "DICT ENTRY MISSING" TO DT-MSG
    END-REWRITE
    CLOSE DICT-FILE.

EXPOSE-ENTRY.
    MOVE DTR-UDKEY TO WS-UDKEY
    MOVE DTR-KEY-ID OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-ID
    MOVE DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-TYPE
    MOVE DTR-KEY-HASH OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-HASH
    MOVE DTR-KEY-MASK OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-MASK
    MOVE DTR-PART OF DICT-REC TO DT-PART
    MOVE DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC TO DT-ACCT
    MOVE DTR-CUST OF DICT-REC TO DT-CUST
    MOVE DTR-NAME OF DICT-REC TO DT-NAME
    MOVE DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC TO DT-KEY-STATUS
    MOVE DTR-CLAIM-STATUS OF DICT-REC TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
    MOVE DTR-CLAIM-ID OF DICT-REC TO DT-CLAIM-ID
    MOVE DTR-FRAUD-FLAG OF DICT-REC TO DT-FRAUD-FLAG
    MOVE DTR-SELF-FLAG OF DICT-REC TO DT-SELF-FLAG
    MOVE DTR-DATE OF DICT-REC TO DT-DATE
    MOVE DTR-VERSION OF DICT-REC TO DT-VERSION.

EXPOSE-CLAIM.
    MOVE CLM-ID TO DT-CLAIM-ID
    MOVE CLM-TYPE TO DT-CLAIM-TYPE
    MOVE CLM-SRC-PART TO DT-DONOR-PART
    MOVE CLM-DST-PART TO DT-CLAIMER-PART
    MOVE CLM-CUST TO DT-CLAIMER-CUST
    MOVE CLM-ACCT TO DT-CLAIMER-ACCT
    MOVE CLM-STATUS TO DT-CLAIM-STATUS
    MOVE CLM-RESOL-END TO DT-RESOL-END
    MOVE CLM-COMPL-END TO DT-COMPL-END
    MOVE CLM-CONFIRM-REASON TO DT-CONFIRM-REASON
    MOVE CLM-CANCEL-REASON TO DT-CANCEL-REASON
    MOVE CLM-CANCELLED-BY TO DT-CANCELLED-BY.

ACQUIRE-LOCK.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LOCK-NAME
    STRING "DICTK-" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-KEY-ID)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-LOCK-NAME
    END-STRING
    IF DT-OPERATOR NOT = SPACES
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(DT-OPERATOR) TO WS-LOCK-OWNER
    ELSE
        MOVE "DICT" TO WS-LOCK-OWNER
    END-IF
    MOVE "A" TO WS-LOCK-MODE
    CALL "BLCK" USING WS-LOCK-NAME WS-LOCK-OWNER WS-LOCK-MODE
        WS-LOCK-ST
    IF WS-LOCK-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "24" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY LOCKED BY CONCURRENT OP" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-LOCKED.

RELEASE-LOCK.
    IF WS-LOCKED = "Y"
        MOVE "R" TO WS-LOCK-MODE
        CALL "BLCK" USING WS-LOCK-NAME WS-LOCK-OWNER WS-LOCK-MODE
            WS-LOCK-ST
        MOVE "N" TO WS-LOCKED
    END-IF.

DROP-LOCK.
    PERFORM RELEASE-LOCK.

DO-SYNC.
    IF DT-KEY-ID NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM LOAD-BY-ID
    ELSE
        PERFORM CANONICALIZE
        IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
        PERFORM FIND-ENTRY
        IF WS-EXIST NOT = "Y"
            MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
            MOVE "PIX KEY NOT REGISTERED IN DICT" TO DT-MSG
            PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF DT-RC NOT = "00"
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DTR-KEY-STATUS OF DICT-REC NOT = "ACTIVE"
        MOVE "23" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY NOT AVAILABLE" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-VERSION > 0 AND DT-VERSION < DTR-VERSION OF DICT-REC
        MOVE "22" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT VERSION AHEAD OF SYNC BASE" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-ACCT NOT = SPACES AND DT-ACCT NOT = DTR-ACCT OF DICT-REC
        MOVE "21" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT ACCOUNT MISMATCH" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-PART NOT = SPACES AND DT-PART NOT = DTR-PART
                                               OF DICT-REC
        MOVE "21" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT PARTICIPANT MISMATCH" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DT-KEY-TYPE NOT = SPACES AND
       DT-KEY-TYPE NOT = DTR-KEY-TYPE OF DICT-REC
        MOVE "21" TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT KEY TYPE MISMATCH" TO DT-MSG
        PERFORM DROP-LOCK GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO DT-MATCH
    PERFORM EXPOSE-ENTRY
    MOVE "PIX KEY CONSISTENT IN DICT" TO DT-MSG.

BUILD-PATHS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DICT-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxdict.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-DICT-PATH
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-DKEY-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxdictk.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-DKEY-PATH
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CLAIM-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxclaim.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CLAIM-PATH.

OPEN-DICT.
    OPEN I-O DICT-FILE
    IF WS-DICT-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT DICT-FILE
        CLOSE DICT-FILE
        OPEN I-O DICT-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-DICT-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-DICT-ST TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT STORE OPEN ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

OPEN-DKEY.
    OPEN I-O DKEY-FILE
    IF WS-DKEY-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT DKEY-FILE
        CLOSE DKEY-FILE
        OPEN I-O DKEY-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-DKEY-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-DKEY-ST TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT INDEX OPEN ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.

OPEN-CLAIM.
    OPEN I-O CLAIM-FILE
    IF WS-CLAIM-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT CLAIM-FILE
        CLOSE CLAIM-FILE
        OPEN I-O CLAIM-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-CLAIM-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-CLAIM-ST TO DT-RC
        MOVE "DICT CLAIM STORE OPEN ERROR" TO DT-MSG
    END-IF.
